From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000010 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wooseong Kim <innocarpe@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] test(pager): align product baseline expectations

Refresh stale vendor pager test expectations after DeepSeek Build product
branding and theme/default diagnostics changed. The CLI parser now brands the
binary as `dsb`, the auto-dark rollback follows the classic
`deepseeknight` product default, doctor counts the separate tmux DCS
passthrough issue, and the welcome tight-height assertion matches the current
8-row logo boundary.

diff --git a/third_party/grok-build/crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager/src/app/dispatch/tests/settings.rs b/third_party/grok-build/crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager/src/app/dispatch/tests/settings.rs
